QURANIC CONTENT AND MUSHAF ASSETS
================================================================================

The Quranic text, mushaf page imagery, glyph fonts, and coordinate databases
bundled with or downloaded by this application are NOT covered by the Apache
License. They remain the property of their respective publishers and are used
under their own terms.

Each asset's source, version, licence, and required attribution is recorded in
assets/ATTRIBUTION.md and reproduced verbatim in assets/licences/. That
attribution is displayed in the application's About screen, which is a licence
obligation and must not be removed.

Expected sources, to be verified before bundling (see docs/02-data-sources.md
and Phase 0 Batch 0.4):

  - Arabic Quran text — Tanzil.net / King Fahd Glorious Quran Printing Complex
  - Mushaf page images — the quran.com-images project
  - Ayah and word coordinate data — the ayahinfo databases
  - QPC glyph fonts — King Fahd Glorious Quran Printing Complex, via the
    Quran Foundation
  - Recitation audio — everyayah.com, the Islamic Network CDN, and the
    Quran Foundation CDN (streamed, not bundled)
  - Translations — the Quran Foundation API (downloaded on request)

No Quranic text in this application is modified in any way. Source files are
shipped byte-identical and verified by SHA-256 checksum at build time.

